{"a":[26,26],"h":"<p>26.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"86\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 86.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 30.8 30.8 46.6 46.6 51.8 58.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 51.8 58.6 69.8\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"109\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 109.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.6 21.7 21.7 21.7 28.6 28.6 41.3 41.3 57.0 57.0 67.6 83.3 88.6 95.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 67.6 88.6 95.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » ye nâzır olup âcileye mahabbetle Âhıreti terkten tahzir ve mevt halini tasvirdir.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"69\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 69.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 33.0 39.7 46.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.0 39.7 46.4 53.2\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> - zamiri, Dünyaya mahabbet eden nefse yâhud o karîne ile ruha raci'dir.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"86\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 86.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.7 27.7 34.4 41.3 48.7 48.7 55.4 63.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 41.3 48.7 69.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> - Terkuvenin cem'idirki boyunun dibinden kollara doğru olan köprücük kemiklerine denir. </p>"}